2026-07-27T10:34:57.2533607Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T10:34:57.2534231Z i /tmp/RtmpLI5ngk/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:34:57.2534926Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:34:57.2535439Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:34:57.2535879Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:34:57.2536675Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:34:57.2537707Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:34:57.2538628Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
